{"id":9606116770104,"title":"Robotic Cat Nybble Q Coding Robot Cat | Petoi","handle":"petoi-nybble-q-robot-cat","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"kai-product-desc\" style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNYBBLE Q - AT A GLANCE\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBest for:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAdvanced makers who want the most expressive open-source robot platform, researchers studying feline quadruped locomotion, developers building complex multi-DOF behavior systems, and educators who want a more challenging, curriculum-rich build experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat it is:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eAn open-source programmable four-legged robot cat - Petoi's original platform (Indiegogo 2018, delivered 2019). 11 servo joints for richer, more expressive movement patterns. Same OpenCat framework and full programming compatibility as Bittle X - Python API, Arduino IDE, Coding Blocks, ROS2.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey specs:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e11 servo joints (2 head + 1 tail + 8 legs) · BiBoard (ESP32) · Built-in WiFi + Bluetooth + voice mic · Python API · Arduino IDE · Coding Blocks · ROS2 · Raspberry Pi + Nvidia Jetson compatible · ~3 hr assembly (kit)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eFrom $249 (kit) \/ $299 (pre-assembled) ·\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e1 year ·\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCurriculum:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eFree STEM curriculum compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eMeet Nybble Q\u003cbr\u003e– the Smart, Interactive, Adorable Open Source Robot Cat\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/Meet_Nybble_Q_the_Smart_Interactive_Adorable_Open_Source_Robot_Cat_-_no_text_-_1046px_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764232435\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Meet Nybble Q, the Smart, Interactive, Adorable\nOpen Source Robot Cat.\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e📺 As featured on KTVU Fox 2 San Francisco with Claudine Wong — \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=UNP5bdrhWPE\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eWatch the segment →\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc_h3\"\u003e35+ Lifelike Behaviors via Mobile App Control or Voice Commands\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e10 additional customized voice commands can be programmed in C++\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/7f23aef2c4cd40d3ba99d154b5749fa3.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"auto\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eNote: some prior coding experience in Scratch, C++ or Python is highly desirable. Kids under 10 can enjoy building and coding Nybble Q with adult supervision.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc_h3\"\u003eSmart Adorable Responses via Built-in Sensors\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/1e0b46237855475b8cd1d7010c9c8941.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"auto\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc_h3\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/docs.petoi.com\/apis\/serial-protocol\/feedback-servos\"\u003eAdvanced Feedback Servos\u003c\/a\u003e Power Human-Guided Robotics Skill Creation\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/666bce7ad6f14ec3b516f524c47ae64f.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"auto\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eA Robot Cat That Teaches Robotics Coding and Entertains\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\u003cimg data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_roboto_cat_coding_language_support_-_c_python_block_coding_1024px_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764230843\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"Nybble Q roboto cat coding language support - c++, python, block coding 1024pxs\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5 style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eFrom robotics coding education to robotics DIY projects, AI robotics applications or research , Nybble Q adapts to every skill level, supporting \u003ca href=\"\/pages\/resources-curriculum-stem-coding-robot\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eblock-based coding, Python \u0026amp; C++\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eNo-code Robotics Skill Programming with \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/docs.petoi.com\/desktop-app\/skill-composer\" target=\"\"\u003ePetoi Skill Composer\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"kai-product-desc_p\"\u003e\u003cvideo data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/6da34a983f934a0198d302404653c1f4.mp4\" class=\"video lazyload\" preload=\"auto\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" controls=\"controls\" loop=\"loop\" autoplay=\"autoplay\" playsinline=\"\" muted=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/video\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/nybble-q-accessories\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eOptional Accessories\u003c\/a\u003e to Enhance Your Experiences\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/nybble-q-accessories\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e \u003cimg width=\"1024\" height=\"auto\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_robot_cat_-_petoi_controller_stand_accessory_-_16x9_68c7558d-3878-439a-a1a5-4fb836f2cc60_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764222694\" alt=\"nybble q robot cat - petoi controller + coding stand accessory\" class=\"kai-product-desc-img lazyload\"\u003e \u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eOptional integration with Raspberry Pi and Arduino Modules for AI Robotics\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"kai-product-desc-center custom-image-center\"\u003e\u003cimg width=\"1024\" height=\"auto\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0550\/2015\/9160\/files\/nybble_q_robotc_cat_raspberry_pi_integration_1024x1024.jpg?v=1764222953\" class=\"lazyload\" alt=\"Program Petoi Nybble Q Robot Cat with Raspberry Pi\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch5 style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003eGive extra CPU, memory, and sensor support to Nybble Q for tasks such as reinforcement learning and autonomous navigation.\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"kai-product-desc-center\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/opencat-open-source-robot-pet-framework\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eOpenCat Open Source Platform\u003c\/a\u003e for Advanced Users to Hack Their Own Quadrupeds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/pages\/opencat-open-source-robot-pet-framework\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e \u003cimg width=\"1024\" height=\"auto\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.petoi.com\/cdn\/shop\/files\/opencat_intro_1024x1024.png?v=1670305427\" class=\"lazyload\" alt=\"Petoi open source robo